hamsterdan-agents
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of Hamsterdan's agent adapter and its host
composition (https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan), pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan. It follows the behavior of
src/hamsterdan/agents/{pi,protocol}.py and
src/hamsterdan/host/{agenticus,pi_a2,pi_workspace,binding}.py, and its test
suite ports the upstream tests in tests/unit/agents/, tests/unit/host/ and
tests/integration/host/ that cover them.

